  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>On the shore of Lake Sainte-Croix, in Bauduen, this rental operator offers kayaks and paddleboards to explore the lake's turquoise waters, with the cliffs plunging into the water as a backdrop.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>This page does not refer to a single operator. In Bauduen, the Lacs et Gorges du Verdon tourist office says Playa Location and the Centre Nautique de Bauduen accept animals on a leash; the Playa Location website also states "animals accepted on a leash" and offers kayaks, paddleboards, canoes, pedal boats and electric boats. No published rule says whether a dog may board a kayak or paddleboard, and at Playa Location some boats admit dogs while others do not. Rules therefore vary from one operator to another: call before you go.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before coming to confirm availability and the conditions for your dog, especially in high season.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Lake Sainte-Croix and the Verdon Gorges are right next door, to extend the outing on the water or on foot.</p>
    </div>

